sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant Bot as Telegram or CLI entry
    participant Orch as Hub command handler
    participant Mem as Hub memory store

    You->>Bot: /learn "Prefer Telegram for operator control"
    Bot->>Orch: explicit learning command
    Orch->>Mem: create active operator semantic memory
    Note over Orch,Mem: Bypasses the routing LLM path<br/>No approval gate<br/>Later auto-learning cannot override this operator record
    Mem-->>Orch: learning id + stored value
    Orch-->>Bot: confirmation text
    Bot-->>You: stored learning confirmation
